<h1>Your custom domain is live</h1>

<p><strong><%= @account.name %></strong> is now serving at
   <a href="https://<%= @domain.hostname %>/">https://<%= @domain.hostname %>/</a>
   (and <a href="https://<%= @apex %>/">https://<%= @apex %>/</a>).</p>

<p>The certificate is deployed and traffic is flowing through Cloudflare. Leave the
   <code>_acme-challenge</code> TXT records in your DNS — they aren't one-time, and
   the certificate uses them again each time it renews.</p>

<p>— Kindred Quill</p>
